//  ccwrap llibcxx03: a minimal separate-chaining hash table backing the unordered
//  containers for Open Watcom. Buckets are a vector<node*>; each bucket is a
//  singly-linked list. A KeyOfValue functor lets unordered_set store the value and
//  unordered_map store a pair keyed on .first (mirrors __tree). Forward iteration
//  walks bucket to bucket. Classic C++03 body.
